WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Expected behavior needs
an independent basis.

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.880
For a negative payment, the approved
contract says rejection with no

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:11.120
balance or ledger change.
The implementation may contain a defect,

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.320
so copying its current behavior
is not a trustworthy oracle.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:18.560
Review the generated assertions
against the contract and challenge

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.360
their side-effect checks. The candidate
should pass valid code and fail

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.360
a relevant seeded fault before
it is considered useful evidence.
